WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.664
The palace banquet hall was ready. Emperor Taizu of Song worried that the generals' power was too great and threatened the throne.

00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:13.310
Lanterns hung high, and the fragrance of wine filled the air.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:19.564
He laid out a lavish banquet and, all smiles, welcomed the important generals who held military power.

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:28.266
The banquet was lively; the generals raised their wine cups one after another, drank heartily, and toasted the emperor.

00:00:28.616 --> 00:00:38.720
After several rounds of wine, Emperor Taizu kindly urged the generals to hand over their military power and enjoy wealth and honor in peace.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:46.294
The generals nodded again and again, handed over their tiger tallies, and willingly gave up their military power.

00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:55.092
From then on, 'relieving military power over a cup of wine' became a famous story of the Song strengthening central rule, told for a thousand years.

00:00:55.442 --> 00:01:00.170
Under the sunset, the palace was especially peaceful.

